sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    actor Arb as Arbiter
    participant Web as Next.js App
    participant API as Typed API Client
    participant Mock as MSW Handlers
    participant DB as Mock DB + Scheduler

    Note over DB: Finding.status = Verified<br/>challengeWindowExpiresAt = now + 30s<br/>scheduleOnce("autopay:<findingId>", 30s)

    alt Developer disputes within the challenge window
        Dev->>Web: Click "Dispute", enter reason
        Web->>API: disputeFinding(findingId, {developerId, reason})
        API->>Mock: POST /api/findings/:id/dispute
        Mock->>DB: disputeFinding()
        DB->>DB: Validate status==Verified and window not expired
        DB->>DB: cancelChallengeWindow() - cancels pending autopay timer
        DB->>DB: Finding.status = Disputed
        Mock->>DB: openDispute()
        DB->>DB: Create Dispute (ruling=Pending)
        DB-->>Mock: Dispute
        Mock-->>API: 201 Dispute
        API-->>Web: Finding now Disputed

        Arb->>Web: Open /arbiter (Pending tab)
        Web->>API: listDisputes({ruling: "Pending"})
        API->>Mock: GET /api/arbiter/disputes?ruling=Pending
        Mock->>DB: listDisputes() + join Finding + PoCSubmission
        DB-->>Mock: ArbiterDisputeView[]
        Mock-->>API: 200 ArbiterDisputeView[]
        API-->>Web: Show developer reason, sandbox log, LLM explanation
        Arb->>Web: Confirm ruling (ForAuditor | AgainstAuditor)
        Web->>API: ruleOnDispute(disputeId, {arbiterId, ruling})
        API->>Mock: POST /api/arbiter/disputes/:id/rule
        Mock->>DB: ruleOnDispute()
        alt ruling = ForAuditor
            DB->>DB: Finding.status = Paid<br/>Contract.status = Resolved<br/>AuditorProfile.reputation += 1
        else ruling = AgainstAuditor
            DB->>DB: Finding.status = Rejected<br/>AuditorProfile.reputation -= 1<br/>AuditorProfile.stake -= 100 (floored at 0)
        end
        DB-->>Mock: Dispute (ruled)
        Mock-->>API: 200 Dispute
        API-->>Web: Dispute removed from Pending list

    else No dispute before the window elapses
        DB->>DB: Timer fires: autopay callback
        DB->>DB: Guard: Finding.status still Verified?
        DB->>DB: Finding.status = Paid<br/>Contract.status = Resolved
        Web->>API: listFindings(contractId) (polling)
        API->>Mock: GET /api/contracts/:id/findings
        Mock-->>API: 200 Finding[] (Paid)
        API-->>Web: Show Paid status to Developer/Auditor
    end
